# Android

- Owner path: AG-11 / SK-11. Specs from AG-03 before non-trivial builds.
- No AccessibilityService or custom IME to observe other apps (ADR-0002).
- Prefer Kotlin + Jetpack Compose; keep WorkManager/battery budgets in mind (NFR).
- Load `docs/11-agent-system/skills/SK-11-android-development/SKILL.md` and its `references/` as needed — not the whole `docs/` tree.
